<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 327)</h2>
<p><b>A long-standing silent sync bug is fixed.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Seeking back to the exact frame a peer had just driven you to was silently never shared — the room quietly fell out of step until the next move. Voice-note playback that returns to its starting frame was the visible case; any scrub back to a peer's parked frame could do it. The echo protection this came from now only applies in the brief window it was designed for.</li>
<li>Playing a voice note with a recorded playhead track now drives the whole room correctly from the app side too, end to end.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
