<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 324)</h2>
<p><b>Reply to comments — in the app and on the web.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Every comment now has a Reply field in the app's notes sidebar, and a matching "Reply…" affordance on the web page. Replies are attributed, tinted so they read as replies at a glance, and shown threaded under their comment on every seat.</li>
<li>Two people replying to the same comment at the same time both survive, everywhere — replies merge, they never overwrite.</li>
<li>Deleting a reply follows the comment rule: your own replies anywhere, any reply if you're the host. Deleted replies stay deleted across reconnects.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
