</style>
<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 322)</h2>
<p><b>Comment ownership: delete your own, host deletes any — and two sync fixes.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Comments can now be deleted from the web page — but only your own; in the app, guests likewise see the delete button only on their own comments, while the session host can delete any. Deletions reach every seat and stay deleted (they survive reconnects and mailbox replays).</li>
<li>On the web, the pointer tool now only grabs your own marks, and pressing Delete removes the grabbed mark for everyone.</li>
<li>Fixed: two browser seats in one room flooded each other with join messages, which could swallow other updates mid-session.</li>
<li>Fixed: after a voice note finished playing, the app could snap the room back to the note's first frame.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
